        "extras": {
            "title_1": {
                "en": "Introduction"
            },
            "content_1": {
                "en": "The Cachorros Club Ministry was developed in Spain and voted as the EUD territory program for ages 3 to 5 by the Inter-European Division Youth Advisory in 2020. Cachorro is the Spanish word for puppy and cub; they are, so to speak, the “infants” of certain mammals, just like our cachorros are the youngest of our Club Ministries (ages 3 to 15).<br><br>Its aim is to provide a holistic approach to a child’s education, catering for their physical, mental, intellectual and spiritual needs.<br><br>Ellen G. White wrote about the importance of exerting a positive influence during a child’s earliest years:<br><br>“The work of education and training should commence with the babyhood of the child; for then the mind is the most impressible, and the lessons given are remembered.”<br>Child Guidance, p. 26 (Ellen G. White)<br><br>“Oh, that they might realize that the bias which is given to a child in its earliest years gives a tendency to character and shapes the destiny either for eternal life or eternal death!”<br>Signs of the Times, April 16, 1896."
            }
        }
    },
